Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:37.18,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de lo externo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:37.96,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Mover tu cuerpo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:38.83,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}muy importante
